    <panel_attributes>title=SD08 Connect Email Account with OAuth, or Upload .eml Files (F14 / UC12)
obj=Student~Student ACTOR
obj=:SettingsPage~SP
obj=:EmailAPI~EAPI
obj=:EmailSyncService~ESS
obj=:EmailProviderRegistry~REG
obj=:GmailAdapter~GA
obj=:CredentialVault~CV
obj=:EmailAccount~ACC CREATED_LATER
obj=Google OAuth\n(consent + token endpoint)\n&lt;&lt;external&gt;&gt;~G

Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;SP : 1: connectGmail()
SP-&gt;&gt;&gt;EAPI : 2: startConnect(req); on=EAPI
EAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;ESS : 3: startConnect(userId); on=ESS
ESS-&gt;&gt;&gt;REG : 4: getAdapter("GMAIL"); on=REG
REG.&gt;ESS : 5: GmailAdapter; off=REG
ESS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GA : 6: buildAuthUrl(userId, state); on=GA
GA.&gt;ESS : 7: authUrl (scope gmail.readonly,\naccess_type=offline, PKCE); off=GA
ESS.&gt;EAPI : 8: authUrl; off=ESS
EAPI.&gt;SP : 9: 200 {authUrl}; off=EAPI
SP-&gt;&gt;&gt;G : 10: browser redirect to consent screen
Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;G : 11: reviews and grants read-only access
G-&gt;&gt;&gt;EAPI : 12: oauthCallback(req)  [code, state]; on=EAPI
combinedFragment=alt~f1 SP G; EAPI:[state mismatch or access denied]
EAPI.&gt;SP : 13: 400 (nothing stored)
..=f1; EAPI:[consent granted]
EAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;ESS : 14: completeConnect(userId, code); on=ESS
ESS-&gt;&gt;&gt;GA : 15: exchangeAuthCode(code); on=GA
GA-&gt;&gt;&gt;G : 16: POST token endpoint
G.&gt;GA : 17: access + refresh token
GA.&gt;ESS : 18: TokenSet; off=GA
ESS-&gt;&gt;&gt;CV : 19: encrypt(plain); on=CV
CV.&gt;ESS : 20: ciphertext; off=CV
ESS-&gt;&gt;&gt;ACC : 21: &lt;&lt;create&gt;&gt; (status ACTIVE,\nencryptedRefreshToken)
ESS.&gt;EAPI : 22: EmailAccount; off=ESS
EAPI.&gt;SP : 23: redirect to Settings ("Gmail\nconnected"); off=EAPI
--=f1
text=Student:--- alternative without OAuth\n(course demo / privacy-preferring\nusers) ---
Student-&gt;&gt;&gt;SP : 24: uploadEml(files)
SP-&gt;&gt;&gt;EAPI : 25: uploadEml(req); on=EAPI
EAPI-&gt;&gt;&gt;ESS : 26: importEmlFiles(userId, files); on=ESS
text=ESS:EmlFileAdapter feeds the same\npipeline as SD09
ESS.&gt;EAPI : 27: processed count; off=ESS
EAPI.&gt;SP : 28: 200 OK; off=EAPI
